Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.34,0:14:38.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把税乘以二  不是把罗马尼亚的税收乘以二
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:41.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's the deal? Are you trying to buying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:41.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么意思  你要收买我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this the way you get girls to go out with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你都这样约女孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:45.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:45.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:52.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're taking this all wrong. If I didn't leave you that tip...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:52.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你误会了  要是我没给这笔小费
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:55.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you wouldn't have come down here, we wouldn't have this argument...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:55.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就不会来  我们不会争吵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:58.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- and there wouldn't be this heat between us. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-也不会有这种紧张的气氛  -什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:01.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, you gotta admit
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:01.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得承认
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that our relationship is hitting a new level now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的关系有进展了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:06.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}'Cause you used to be like the chef and I was the customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:06.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以前你是厨师  我是顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:09.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But now we're like this couple that fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:09.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我们是两个争吵的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.59,0:15:12.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you're a loon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.59,0:15:12.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是个疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:17.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, forget the check, okay? I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:17.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别管这张支票了  我喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:19.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you're great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:19.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得你很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么样  你什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.10,0:15:26.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.10,0:15:26.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:27.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:27.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:31.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't wanna encourage this kind of behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:31.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想鼓励这种行为
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:36.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One meal. That's all I'm asking for. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:36.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只求一顿饭  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:37.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We go out, we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:37.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们出去吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:41.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't have a good time, I'll give you 10 grand, we're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:41.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是玩得不开心  我给你一万  我们扯平
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:58.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, no. Just put the mail down. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:58.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  把信放下  是我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:02.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry. Why were you just like all in the dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:02.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  你怎么不开灯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.43,0:16:08.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your laundry smelled so good that I thought I'd curl up in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.43,0:16:08.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的衣服好香  我就窝在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.65,0:16:10.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Is that all right? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.65,0:16:10.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没关系吧  -没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how was your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天过得怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:16.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just probably the worst one since I've been alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:16.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可能是我有生以来最惨的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.11,0:16:20.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.11,0:16:20.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:24.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alice.... She called it off. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:24.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爱丽丝改变心意了 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.89,0:16:26.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.89,0:16:26.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did she say why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她有说原因吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No not really. Just that I was too young.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有  她只说我太年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:37.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know but I don't see how I could suddenly be too young...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:37.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么突然变年轻了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:41.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because I'm older than I was when we first got together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:41.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可比我们刚交往时老成不少
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的是的  我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:48.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. But you know what? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:48.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道  但是你知道吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.05,0:16:49.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it's just all for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.05,0:16:49.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许这样也好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.70,0:16:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yeah, if the best is like unbelievable pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.70,0:16:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  如果"好"就是我好痛苦的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:59.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I was just finally happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:59.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好不容易感到快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, for the first time in my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是生平第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.41,0:17:05.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}after my dad left me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.41,0:17:05.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先是爸爸离开我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.62,0:17:09.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and then and then getting arrested for stealing those birds...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.62,0:17:09.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后偷鸟被逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:14.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and then the whole punctured-lung thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:14.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后又肺穿孔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:19.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's still really hard to take deep breaths in cold weather...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:19.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天气一冷  我还是很难深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:23.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but with Alice, all that stuff kind of went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:23.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是有了爱丽丝  这些都不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:28.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now and now it's gone, and I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:28.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我失去了  却不知道原因
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.69,0:17:34.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I can tell you why. It's because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.69,0:17:34.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以告诉你原因  是我害的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:38.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you know what? I only did it because I love you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:38.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我是爱你才这么做的  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:43.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:43.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.28,0:17:46.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I kind of had a little chat with Alice...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.28,0:17:46.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟爱丽丝聊了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I sort of made her see why you two shouldn't be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让她明白你们为何不能在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:53.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you're gonna see it too, one day. You really, really will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:53.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你总有一天也会明白的  真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:55.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute. This is because of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:55.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下  是你造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.91,0:17:58.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay. - Wait, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.91,0:17:58.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好了  -等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:18:00.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mother didn't want us to be together...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:18:00.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈反对我们在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:04.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but the worst thing she every did was tie me to the porch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:04.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是她顶多把我绑在门廊上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:09.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I came to you because I thought you'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:09.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得你能了解  所以才来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.94,0:18:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.94,0:18:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:13.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:13.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.66,0:18:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would storm out of here right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.66,0:18:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很想立刻摔门走人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:20.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}if I had some money or a place to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:20.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我没钱  没地方去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.90,0:18:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God! The millionaire's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.90,0:18:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天哪  百万富翁来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:30.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:30.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys, please, I'm just gonna have dinner with him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位  别这样  我只是要跟他吃顿饭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, just because he buys you dinner 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧记住了  他请你吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:43.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}does not mean you owe him anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}并不代表你欠他什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.82,0:18:45.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.82,0:18:45.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:49.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, then get the lobster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:49.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那记得点龙虾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How much cash you got in your pocket now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你口袋里有多少现金
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:06.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's why I'm not inviting you in for a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:06.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我就不请你进来喝一杯了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:09.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Bye. - Why not? Hey, come in for drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:09.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拜  -进来坐一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:13.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Where do you wanna go? - You like pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:13.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你想去哪里  -你喜欢吃披萨吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.10,0:19:17.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That sounds great. - I know a great little place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.10,0:19:17.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-听起来不错  -有一家馆子不错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:26.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not paying for the pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:26.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能让你付比萨钱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:29.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, it's only fair. You paid for the flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:29.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我付吧  这样才公平  你出了机票钱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that enough lira?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些里拉够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.93,0:19:33.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd throw another 1000 on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.93,0:19:33.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再丢个一千
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:37.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How much is that? - That's about 60 cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:37.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这些是多少  -大约六毛美金
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every night!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每晚都这样
